  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Corporate Strategy and Communications"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Corporate strategy and corporate communication are closely aligned. Corporate strategy defines the scope of the firm in terms of the industries and markets in which it competes allowing for strategy decisions related to such matters as investment in diversification, vertical integration, acquisitions, and new ventures. The corporate communication function contributes to the implementation of those strategic decisions through effective communication with strategic stakeholders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by : Ted Rogers School of Business Management, Entrepreneurship & Strategy Department School of Professional Communication"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions : This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Professional Communication",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Professional Communication",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/fcad/procomm/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Creative Industries",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Creative Industries",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/fcad/creative_industries/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses in total from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Three (3) Required courses:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "BUS 600 Introduction to Contemporary Business Strategy or BUS 800 Strategic Management or BSM 600 The Mature Business",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "BUS 600",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/business/BUS/600/"
        },
        {
          "text": "BUS 800",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/business/BUS/800/"
        },
        {
          "text": "BSM 600",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/business-essentials/BSM/600/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "CMN 279 Introduction to Professional Communication or CMN 200 Introduction to Professional Writing",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CMN 279",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication/CMN/279/"
        },
        {
          "text": "CMN 200",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication/CMN/200/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "CMN 413 Corporate Communications",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CMN 413",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication/CMN/413/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus one (1) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "BUS 850 Strategy Development in Uncertain Times",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "BUS 850",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/business/BUS/850/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "CMN 306 Risk and Crisis Communication",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CMN 306",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication/CMN/306/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
